Feature: Petstore API CRUD operations\n\n  Scenario: Create a new pet\n    Given the API endpoint is \"https://petstore.swagger.io/v2/pet\"\n    And the request payload is\n      \"\"\"\n      {\n        \"id\": 12345,\n        \"name\": \"Doggie\",\n        \"status\": \"available\"\n      }\n      \"\"\"\n    When I send a POST request\n    Then the response status code should be 200\n    And the response content should contain \"Doggie\"\n\n  Scenario: Get a pet by ID\n    Given the API endpoint is \"https://petstore.swagger.io/v2/pet/12345\"\n    When I send a GET request\n    Then the response status code should be 200\n    And the response content should contain \"Doggie\"\n\n  Scenario: Update a pet\n    Given the API endpoint is \"https://petstore.swagger.io/v2/pet\"\n    And the request payload is\n      \"\"\"\n      {\n        \"id\": 12345,\n        \"name\": \"Doggie\",\n        \"status\": \"sold\"\n      }\n      \"\"\"\n    When I send a PUT request\n    Then the response status code should be 200\n    And the response content should contain \"sold\"\n\n  Scenario: Delete a pet\n    Given the API endpoint is \"https://petstore.swagger.io/v2/pet/12345\"\n    When I send a DELETE request\n    Then the response status code should be 200\n    And the response content should contain \"Pet deleted\"